{"id":"12a315bba5062a88","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-consistency.md","title":"Boolean Erasure and Consistency of GL","display":"thm-gl-consistency — Boolean Erasure and Consistency of GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-consistency","aliases":["89-thm-gl-consistency"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-gl-consistency — Boolean Erasure and Consistency of GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","[[89-df-box-free-fragment]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-consistency — Boolean Erasure and Consistency of GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78885ae02bfb25f\" href=\"?note=c78885ae02bfb25f\" title=\"89-df-box-free-fragment\">89-df-box-free-fragment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为 Gödel–Löb 定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为命题重言式集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_0\">\\(e:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_0\\)</span> 是下列结构递归引入的去盒函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ne(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,&amp;e(p)&amp;\\coloneqq p,\\\\\ne(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg e(A),&amp;e(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq e(A)\\land e(B),\\\\\ne(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;(e(A)\\in\\mathcal T_{\\Box}),\\\\\n&amp;\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL},\\qquad(\\Box p\\to p)\\notin\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ne(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,&amp;e(p)&amp;\\coloneqq p,\\\\\ne(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg e(A),&amp;e(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq e(A)\\land e(B),\\\\\ne(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;(e(A)\\in\\mathcal T_{\\Box}),\\\\\n&amp;\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL},\\qquad(\\Box p\\to p)\\notin\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 11；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>去盒函数沿唯一有限公式树递归。把最外层每个盒赋为真，则命题重言式的去盒结果仍为重言式；K 公理和 Löb 公理去盒后分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\to(\\top\\to\\top)\">\\(\\top\\to(\\top\\to\\top)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\to\\top\">\\(\\top\\to\\top\\)</span>。MP 保重言式，必然化后的去盒结果是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。所以这些公式构成 GL 交集定义的一个闭包候选，或等价地对有限证明归纳得到第一条结论。底去盒仍假，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\\to p\">\\(\\Box p\\to p\\)</span> 去盒为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\to p\">\\(\\top\\to p\\)</span>，故都不能是 GL 定理。整个证明不需要算术一致性或 Kripke 完全性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-propositional-tautology","status":"resolved","id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-free-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"c78885ae02bfb25f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-free-fragment]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"e:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ne(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\bot,&e(p)&\\coloneqq p,\\\\\ne(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\neg e(A),&e(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq e(A)\\land e(B),\\\\\ne(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\n&\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;(e(A)\\in\\mathcal T_{\\Box}),\\\\\n&\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL},\\qquad(\\Box p\\to p)\\notin\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\top\\to(\\top\\to\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top\\to\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p\\to p","display":false},{"tex":"\\top\\to p","display":false}],"bytes":1679,"backlinks":[{"id":"80c765fb7376d531","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84538a9442ddea2d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]] → [[89-df-normal-modal-logic]] → [[89-df-gl-logic]] → [[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal]] → [[89-thm-gl-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","81d2de5abb2876b6","c78885ae02bfb25f"]}